###############################################################################
# Environment Configuration - CAG Estimator                                 ###
###############################################################################
#                                                                           ###
# API Keys:                                                                 ###
#   OPENAI_API_KEY: OpenAI API key for authentication                       ###
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY: Anthropic API key for authentication                 ###
#   GEMINI_API_KEY: Google Gemini API key for authentication                ###
#   At least one of OPENAI_API_KEY / ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is required at       ###
#   startup : the app validates this and refuses to boot without one.       ###
#                                                                           ###
# LLM Configuration:                                                        ###
#   LLM_PROVIDER: Select the LLM provider to use                            ###
#     Options: openai | anthropic | gemini                                  ###
#   LLM_MODEL: Model identifier for the selected provider                   ###
#     Examples: gpt-4o-mini, claude-opus-5, gemini-pro                      ###
#                                                                           ###
# Application Settings:                                                     ###
#   APP_ENV: Environment where the app is running                           ###
#     Options: development | production | staging                           ###
#   LOG_LEVEL: Logging verbosity level                                      ###
#     Options: DEBUG | INFO | WARN | ERROR                                  ###
#                                                                           ###
# LiteLLM Wrapper (provider fallback):                                      ###
#   PRIMARY_MODEL: model tried first (e.g. gpt-4o-mini)                     ###
#   FALLBACK_MODEL: model used if the primary fails after retries           ###
#     (e.g. claude-haiku-4-5-20251001)                                      ###
#   LLM_TIMEOUT: per-call timeout in seconds                                ###
#   LLM_RETRIES: retry attempts on the primary model before falling back    ###
#                                                                           ###
# Redis Cache (exact-match, keyed by system prompt + question + model):     ###
#   REDIS_URL: connection string, e.g. redis://localhost:6379               ###
#     Inside docker-compose this is overridden to redis://redis:6379        ###
#   CACHE_TTL: seconds to keep a cached response before it expires          ###
#                                                                           ###
# Streamlit Client:                                                         ###
#   ESTIMATOR_API_BASE_URL: base URL Streamlit uses to reach this API       ###
#                                                                           ###
###############################################################################
OPENAI_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
LLM_PROVIDER=
LLM_MODEL=
APP_ENV=
LOG_LEVEL=

PRIMARY_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
FALLBACK_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5-20251001
LLM_TIMEOUT=30
LLM_RETRIES=2

REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379
CACHE_TTL=86400

ESTIMATOR_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
